title: 'Studio package typecheck cleanup — 10 pre-existing errors → 0'
summary: 'Cleared accumulated pre-existing typecheck drift in @a-company/atelier-studio that surfaced during the T-007b and T-006 audit passes. Workspace went from 13/14 typechecks green to 14/14. Five categories of fix: four control files dropped unused `private opts` field qualifiers (parameter property created class state that was never read); two unused type imports removed (StepEasing, AnimatableProperty); one dead `deltaPanel` field removed (write-only — DOM cleanup happens via scroll.innerHTML); two real Shape narrowing errors fixed in property-panel.ts by capturing PathShape const before crossing into callback boundaries (TS doesn''t preserve discriminant narrowing across function calls when the source could be mutated); one test fixture (makeTestDoc) had been masking missing required AtelierDocument fields (name, canvas.fps, TextStyle.fontFamily) via `as AtelierDocument` cast — dropped the cast and added the fields properly so future omissions fail loudly. All 28 studio tests pass; full workspace 560/560 green.'
